cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "SolutionReview: verifiability-typed review knowledge with human-gated evolution"
abstract: >-
  Plugin and evaluation artifact for LLM-assisted preliminary review of technical solution
  proposals: verifiability-typed rules (hard/hybrid/soft), a tool-side evidence gate, a
  deterministic verdict policy, and a human-gated learned layer. Includes the 28-rule package,
  the 100-proposal synthetic corpus with 253 planted defects, the ablation runner and the
  published evaluation runs.
